  "definition": {
    "en": "The closed sizes a folded sheet is sold as — what the trade calls a «DL flyer» or «Lang-DL». The format is the closed size; how the sheet is divided into panels is the setup model's business.",
    "nb": "De lukkede målene et falset ark selges som — det bransjen kaller «DL-flyer» eller «Lang-DL». Formatet er det lukkede målet; hvordan arket deles i paneler er oppsettsmodellens sak.",
    "de": "Die geschlossenen Maße, in denen ein gefalzter Bogen verkauft wird — «DIN lang», «Lang-DL». Das Format ist das geschlossene Maß; die Panelaufteilung gehört zum Setup-Modell.",
    "es": "The closed sizes a folded sheet is sold as — what the trade calls a «DL flyer» or «Lang-DL». The format is the closed size; how the sheet is divided into panels is the setup model's business.",
